  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Pertuzumab is a monoclonal antibody that blocks HER2 and is used to treat breast cancer. It is an approved medicine, authorised in the European Union for breast cancer, and is also being studied for other uses.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1998021&quot;>Wikidata Q1998021</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>pertuzumab</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>L01FD02</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB06366&quot;>DB06366</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1998021&quot;>Q1998021</a></td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>148000 g/mol (Drugs.Common (25.09))</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
